    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31382" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσίημι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσω</span>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῆκα</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sendinto,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὴν [λίμνην] εἰ. τὸὕδωρ,</span>
			of rivers, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.109
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ. τοὺς Πέρσας ἐς τὸ τεῖχος</span>
			<i>let</i> them <i>in,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.158
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν [κεδρίην]</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὴν κοιλίην</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.87
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς πολεμίους ἔφη
			εἰσέσθαι</span> said he <i>had let</i> them <i>in,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.3.19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάριτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Sammelb.</u>
					4324.8
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.115.18
			</span></i> (Lex Dracontis). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὖλιν ἐσιέμεναι</span>
			<i>betaking themselves into their own</i> roost, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.470
			</span></i>.</div>
